<Layout
  title="Heat Pump Water Heaters Explained: Cost, Sizing, Install Space | ElectrifyCost"
  description="UEF 3.0-4.0 vs 0.95 resistance, 120V plug-in vs 240V hybrid vs split, household sizing, free-air install rules, condensate routing, refrigerant transition."
  schemaJsonLd={schemaJsonLd}
